     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Saturday, August 29, 2015 at 12:56:58 AM UTC+1, devdreamer wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">I am trying to build up a model selection tool, where the user enters the data and the regression equation, and based on the variables entered in the equation, multiple plots are rendered dynamically. What I want next is a </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">checkbox next to those plots</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">, so that user have the option to decide which plots can be there on the next tab for further analysis. I have attached the image that I am looking for:</span><br><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Below code is for generating multiple plots only, I could not figure out how to even get started with this. Can anyone please help me?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">pageWithSidebar</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n headerPanel</span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Dynamic number of plots&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n  sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#user can upload any data file for the analysis</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   fileInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;file&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Please upload your file&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   checkboxInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inputId</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;header&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;header&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   checkboxInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inputId</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;stringsAsFactors&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;stringsAsFactors&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inputId</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;sep&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">label</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;Separator&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> choices</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Comma</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;,&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Semicolon</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Tab</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;\\t&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Space</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> selected</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;,&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nmainPanel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n   textInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Model&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Please enter your model &quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   actionButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;goButton&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Click to proceed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;plots&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  \r\n\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#get data file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    file1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">file\r\n    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">is.null</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">file1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n     read.table</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">file</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">file1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">datapath</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> header</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">header</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stringsAsFactors</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stringsAsFactors</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> \r\n\r\n\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#model formula entered by the user </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n model </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> eventReactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">goButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Model\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#parsing of model variables</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  variables</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">   \r\n       </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">is.null</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">model</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n            </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">else</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n          all_vars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">all.vars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">parse</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">text</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">model</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n          dependent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">all_vars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#variables on right hand side of the equation after ~</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n          fixed_vector </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> all_vars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">-1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dependent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> fixed_vector</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">   \r\n        </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#rendering multiple plots based on model formula </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">plots </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n           dependent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">variables</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()[[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n           fixed_vector</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">variables</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()[[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n           length_fixed</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">length</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fixed_vector</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n         p</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">length_fixed</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n        </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#multiple ggplots based on variables entered by the user in the model formula</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n         p</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]]&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> aes_string</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dependent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fixed_vector</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]))+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">geom_point</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#using grid.arrange to display multiple plots</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n       do.call</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;grid.arrange&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">p</span><span style=\"col